        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, tushîe diyisha dia malu a tshibangidilu a Kilisto ku nyima, tuyai tô ne ku buakane bua tshishiki; katuteki tshiakabidi bishimikidi bia kukudimuna kua mutshima ku midimu mifue, ne bia ditabusha dia kudi Nzambi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bia diyisha dia kubatiza, ne bia ditentekesha dia bianza, ne bia dibika dia bafue, ne bia dilumbuluisha dia tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netuenze bualu ebu, bitabusha Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda wa bantu aba bakatokeshibua mu munya wa Nzambi musangu umue tshiendelele ne bakalabula diha dia mu diulu, bakavuishibua babanyanganyi ba Nyuma Muimpe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakambula dî dimpe dia Nzambi ne makole a tshikondo tshilualua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne hashishe bakalekela malu â, kubahingasha tshiakabidi kudi dikudimuna dia mutshima kakuena mua kuenjibua tshiendelele, bualu bua badi badishihela kabidi Muana wa Nzambi ku mutshi mutshiamakane, ne badi bamufuisha bundu ku mesu kua bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua buloba buakamana kumina nvula wakaloka ha mutu habu misangu ya bungi ne budi bumenesha midioko idi ikuatshisha bantu badibo babudimina, budi buangata disanka kudi Nzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi bikala buloba bumenesha meba ne nyinyʼa tshisonga, budi buhidibua ne budi hehi ne mulau; kunshikidilu kuabu nkuhia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi, bananga betu, tudi tuitabushishibua malu mahite buimpe bua bualu buenu, malu adi alondangana ne luhandu, nasha tuetu tuamba nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Nzambi kena uhanga buakane bua kuhueye muoyo wa mudimu wenu ne wa dinanga dinuakalesha bua dina diandi, hanuakakuatshila basanto mudimu ne hanutshidi nubakuatshishau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudi basue muntu ne muntu wa munkatshi muenu aleshe disuminyina diodiumue bua kuheta tshiuwidi tshia ditekemena tô ne kunshikidilu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua kanulu bienu bahungidi, kadi nulue bidikishi ba badi bahiana milayi bua ditabusha ne lutulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakalaya Nzambi Abalahama mulayi wandi, hualu bua yeye kakadi ne mukuabo mumuhite bunene bua kuditshiheye kudiye, wakaditshiha mu dina diandi yeye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamba ne, Bulelela, hanasankisha, nenkusankishe wewe; hanavudisha, nenkuvudishe wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bualu bua yeye wakananukila kuikala ne lutulu, wakaheta mulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bantu badi baditshiha kudi udi mubahite bunene, ne mu matandu abo onso mutshihu wabo udi ujadika bualu tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, Nzambi, hakasueye kutamba kulesha bahianyi ha milayi disua diandi didi kadi mua kukudimuka, wakateka kuditshiha kuandi hankatshi habo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua ku malu abidi adi kâi mua kukudimuka, adi Nzambi kai mumanye mua kushimamu, tuikale ne ditantamika dikole dia mutshima, tuetu mene bakanyema bua kulamata ditekemena diakatekabo ku mpala kuetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditekemena ditudi nʼadi bu luongo lua muoyo wetu, didi dikuata bikole, didi dishindama, didi dibuela tô ne munda mua muaba udi ku nyima kua tshilulu tshikudika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuakabuela Yesu bu mudianjidi bua bualu buetu, mumane kulua muakuidi mimene tshiendelele wa ku mulongo wa Melekisedeke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
